    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide a tiny pilot caught between two magnetically-linked orbs through a series of electrified mazes. Your \u201cEmotitron\u201d never stops spinning\u2014every wall is live, every corner is lethal, and every mistake burns away precious milliseconds. Simple to learn, brutally exacting to master, Jira Jira Emotitron distills the spirit of classic stick-dodging games  into a sleek, neon-geometry playground built for modern speedrunning.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide a tiny pilot caught between two magnetically-linked orbs through a series of electrified mazes. Your \u201cEmotitron\u201d never stops spinning\u2014every wall is live, every corner is lethal, and every mistake burns away precious milliseconds. Simple to learn, brutally exacting to master, Jira Jira Emotitron distills the spirit of classic stick-dodging games  into a sleek, neon-geometry playground built for modern speedrunning.</p>",
